    "scenesThatPass": [
      "JANICE: Oh no, that’s yours.\nTAYLOR: Nope, we split even. By myself I wouldn’t have made half this much if I drummed ‘til midnight.\nJANICE: You okay?",
      "TAYLOR: What about you?\nJANICE: Pretty much the same. Where’d you learn to drum?\nTAYLOR: Self-taught. We could do this for a living, you know it? I really think we busk our way to fame and fortune.\nJANICE: What made you stop in front of me? And what made you start moving?",
      "JANICE: And I can’t do it by myself, it’d be Ginger without Fred.\nTAYLOR: I hear that. But you gotta get in here before you go. Group hug.\nTAYLOR: Buskers forever.",
      "CAT: That totally works.\nMISS ROHRBACHER: It totally does.",
      "MISS ROHRBACHER: That’ll change. Believe me, that’ll change. Give it a little time. None of this, none of that - out there - really means anything. This is a…\nMISS ROHRBACHER: Now we’re talkin’.\nCAT: Hey! This is perfect, come on!"
    ]
